		(descr "Two Keystone 82 THM battery clips holding one AAA cell (10.5 x 44.5 mm), cell axis along Y. Origin = cell centre. Holes 1.9 mm in one line at 0 / 7.6 / 35.0 / 42.6 mm (L = 27.4 mm for AAA), per Keystone catalogue p.40 (reference only, verify with real parts). Pad 1 = + clip (top), pad 2 = - clip (bottom); the two holes of one clip share a pad number. https://www.keyelco.com/userAssets/file/K75p40.pdf")
